// alea, one feature at a time · 07 — Your pictures
// Your photos are fields too: open one, its painting as it is; its luminance,
// a field from 0 to 1, painted in ember; its own five colours as a palette;
// the painting itself in pixels; a kaleidoscope of the field in its own
// colours. photo.jpg is yours (a frame of a phone clip here; not in the repo):
// put any photo there.
// Generated by series/gen.py from series/07-pictures.json; the template is the
// generator, the episode is the JSON.

work Episode07 {
  let total = 60.0
